From cff6c99bd82bcc5febae17a672b6843cfb7a5303 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: evilcomputer12 <martinrobotika@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 23:36:43 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 6/7] xgameruntime: Add the remaining GDK runtime classes.

New implementations: XGame (title id), XGameSave (containers/blobs stored as
files under %LOCALAPPDATA%\XodusGames\<titleid>\GameSave, no cloud sync),
XPersistentLocalStorage. Ported from the xodus-gaming wine fork as stubs:
XStore, XPackage, XGameUi, XError, XGameEvent, XDisplay, XLauncher,
XUserDevice, XAccessibility, XAppCapture(+Metadata), XGameInvite,
XGameProtocol, XGameActivation, XGameStreaming. QueryApiImpl now dispatches
the same 24 classes as Microsoft's xgameruntime.dll.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
